    "body": "Found why the corrected prompt scan still did nothing: it used the right array shape from the wrong game version. The installed game is 1.0.1491.50, but the local script set used for the old address is 1.23/1311.12. The current 1491.50 `player_camp` script uses a different prompt-registry address.\n\nThe source and both prompt contracts now use the 1491.50 registry and reject both the old-version address and the earlier one-word-short form. The current binocular scan uses the same stale old-version address and has no successful suppression line in the installed log, so it was not a working current-build reference. I left that separate issue file alone. I did not build or install this repair, so Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#256 remains actionable.",
